A file that is not there is a question that could not be asked: exit 2,
through the verdict verbs' pre-run guard, never a 1 claiming the block
differs.

```console
$ zenctl acl gen --enrollment tests/cmd/fixtures/enrollment.toml --check --against tests/cmd/fixtures/no-such-router.json5
? 2
Error: tests/cmd/fixtures/no-such-router.json5: zenoh refused the config: No such file or directory (os error 2)
acl gen --check: the question could not be asked — exit 2, the reserved non-verdict (1 here would claim a verdict this run never reached)

```
